    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "TeslaMate"
      },
      "description": "Energy recovered through regenerative braking, normalized per 100 $length_unit driven on each firmware version, split by whether climate control was running. Running the A/C or heater draws power from the pack that can offset regen in the same net-power samples, biasing the total downward independent of firmware — comparing the two series isolates the firmware effect from that climate-load noise. Requires the Streaming API to have been enabled during those drives.",
